; Bac dau 0.21 va trailing 0.50/0.50: suy luan, can tick de xac nhan.
; Khung gio 15:23-18:32 la GIO SERVER KVB (GMT+3), chi tu 2 phien quan sat. San GMT+0 (vd Exness): 12:23-15:32.
